{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/undergrounddonutour/items/624612/", "pk": 624612, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/undergrounddonutour/", "pk": 33471, "shortname": "undergrounddonutour", "name": "Underground Donut Tour", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Key West Southernmost Sweet Treats Tour", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 3, "unicode": "Key West Southernmost Sweet Treats Tour", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 32.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 3.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 1136, "description": "## Duration\n\n2 hours \n\n## About\n\nGet ready for a sweet and sunny adventure on a donut tour through Key West, where island vibes meet irresistible treats. Start at the beloved Glazed Donuts on Eaton Street, where small-batch, gourmet donuts fly off the shelves—so get there early before they sell out! Then, discover a local favorite known for their unique “Key West donuts,” a light, crispy delight that captures the laid-back spirit of the island. No trip to Key West is complete without a taste of the iconic Key lime pie, served with a perfect balance of tangy and sweet. Finally, indulge your inner kid with a stop at Mattheessen’s, home to giant, gooey homemade cookies that are as big on flavor as they are in size. It’s a tropical, sugary stroll you won’t want to miss!\n\n## What's Included\n\n- Donuts and pastries\n- A drink of your choice\n- An amazing guided history of Key West\n- Beautiful scenery and locations\n- Lots of family friendly fun\n\n\n## What to Bring\n\nPlease make sure to bring your appetite. There will be plenty of donuts for everyone. This tour is outside, so please dress according to the weather. Also - if you have any food allergies, please let us know ahead of time, so we can prepare accordingly.", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "Key West, FL", "booking_notes": "## Looking for more trip tips? \nCheck out our city guide we've created specifically for your trip. It includes recommendations for parking, restaurants, things to do and so much more! \n**[Download it here](https://e389b42a-26a3-485d-bdd5-eb0d57c6729e.usrfiles.com/ugd/e389b4_00621259280b4752891194362bf2b77d.pdf)**\n\n[![City Guide](https://static.wixstatic.com/media/e389b4_de64c39346284e9bb7f1c270e0d07385~mv2.jpg)](https://e389b42a-26a3-485d-bdd5-eb0d57c6729e.usrfiles.com/ugd/e389b4_00621259280b4752891194362bf2b77d.pdf)\n\n---\n\n## Booked the tour - Now get the Merch!\nThe Underground Donut Tour has a ton of great merchandise for sale as well. Tshirts, hoodies, hats, stickers and more. \n**[Visit our store today!](https://www.undergrounddonuttour.com/store?utm_source=fareharbor&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=confirmationemail)**\n\n[![Donut Merchandise](https://static.wixstatic.com/media/e389b4_d6f9f6aed4f04538872b8c131da7d3c0~mv2.jpg)](https://www.undergrounddonuttour.com/store?utm_source=fareharbor&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=confirmationemail)\n\n_________\n\n**Timely Departures**\nMany of our tours have a tendency to sell out and we have to respect the schedules of our other guests, so we have to begin our tours on time. We will wait until 10 minutes after the hour and then we'll have to begin the tour. If you are going to arrive more than 10 minutes after the start of the tour, please call 844-366-8848 to meet us at our second location.\n\n**Tour Start and End**\nPlease note that all of our tours do not end where they start, so if you have questions regarding parking, public transportation, etc. please ask your guide or contact us prior to the tour for the best recommendations. All tours are roughly 1.5-2 miles long, so you should plan to wear comfortable shoes and clothing, dependent on the weather. Most tours can be walked end to end in about 30 minutes, so you can always walk back to the beginning, take a cab, public transit or find another means of returning to the starting point fairly easily.\n\n__________\n\n## What to Bring\n\nPlease make sure to bring your appetite. There will be plenty of donuts for everyone. This tour is outside, so please dress according to the weather. Also - if you have any food allergies, please let us know ahead of time, so we can prepare accordingly.\n\n## Thanks so much for booking!\n\n_______\n\nPlease know that the tour does not come back to the starting location, so please remember where you parked, if you decide to drive to the tour.\n\nPlease remember that if you need to cancel or reschedule the activity for any reason, you can call 844-366-8848 or email info@undergrounddonuttour.com. If you have any other questions, feel free to get in touch.", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "2 Hours • Offered Many Days Throughout the Week", "short_description": "Explore Old Town Key West with fresh donuts, Key lime pie, tropical treats, local stories, and laid back island vibes. 🌴🍩", "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/undergrounddonutour/items/624612/images/1442454/", "pk": 1442454, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/HPV1P8fNS2qRfCdHLUZP", "image_cdn_url": "